</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/44123c3642a845f62a3817cd8f7600492a6b8491" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.671ex; width:32.294ex; height:4.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H:=H_{\mathbb {Z} }\otimes _{\mathbb {Z} }\mathbb {C} =\bigoplus \nolimits _{p+q=n}H^{p,q},}"/></span></dd>
<dd id="mwIg"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt9" id="mwIw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\overline{H^{p,q}}=H^{q,p}."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle {\overline {H^{p,q}}}=H^{q,p}.}">
