<p id="mwJA">An equivalent definition is obtained by replacing the direct sum decomposition of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt10" id="mwJQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/75a9edddcca2f782014371f75dca39d7e13a9c1b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:2.064ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H}"/></span> by the <b id="mwJg">Hodge filtration</b>, a finite decreasing <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Filtration_(mathematics)" title="Filtration (mathematics)" id="mwJw">filtration</a> of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt11" id="mwKA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>H</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/75a9edddcca2f782014371f75dca39d7e13a9c1b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:2.064ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H}"/></span> by complex subspaces <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt12" id="mwKQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"F^pH (p \\in \\Z),"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle F^{p}H(p\in \mathbb {Z} ),}">
