    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle n}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/a601995d55609f2d9f5e233e36fbe9ea26011b3b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.395ex; height:1.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle n}"/></span>-th <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cohomology_group" title="Cohomology group" class="mw-redirect" id="mwOA">cohomology group</a> of <i id="mwOQ">X</i> with integer coefficients, then <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt19" id="mwOg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H = H^n (X, \\Complex)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H=H^{n}(X,\mathbb {C} )}">
