</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/ca05d5c60c91f324c3e7e73cd18f8f0de4ea348d" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:14.985ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H=H^{n}(X,\mathbb {C} )}"/></span> is its <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt20" id="mwOw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"n"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle n}">
  <semantics>
