</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/c6c813df15dbb76f2e02b3bceb3f16b83a69d9c6" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:3.322ex; height:2.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H^{n}}"/></span> with the decreasing filtration by <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt24" id="mwQg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"F^p H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle F^{p}H}">
