</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/234b78b24e88ae30d843d3d7fcf2e24ff7d6702a" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:3.26ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H_{\mathbb {Z} }}"/></span> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abelian_variety#Polarisation_and_dual_abelian_variety" title="Abelian variety" id="mwVA">polarization</a>), which is extended to <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt32" id="mwVQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H}">
