</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/1e528af863fd84d0edc808c3d9f53be7687a83d3" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:5.101ex; height:2.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle t\neq 0}"/></span> and degenerate to a singular curve at <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt150" id="mwAaM" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"t=0."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle t=0.}">
