</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9248d91021260015d75d2b7540612616bbb36b88" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:5.747ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle t=0.}"/></span> Then, the cohomology sheaves</p>
<dl id="mwAaQ"><dd id="mwAaU"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt151" id="mwAaY" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\R f_*^i \\left( \\underline{\\Q}_{\\Complex ^2} \\right)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} f_{*}^{i}\left({\underline {\mathbb {Q} }}_{\mathbb {C} ^{2}}\right)}">
