</span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/1e4b43dd515314773594b404510bdfb471e5f08f" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:2.325ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} ;}" id="mwAhU"/></span> in other words, if <i id="mwAhY">A</i> is an algebra over <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt44" id="mwAhc" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\R,"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;" id="mwAhg"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} ,}" id="mwAhk">
