-redirect">MR</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=1194180" class="external text">1194180</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)" title="S2CID (identifier)" class="mw-redirect">S2CID</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:117095021" class="external text">117095021</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Singularities+and+Topology+of+Hypersurfaces&amp;rft.place=New+York&amp;rft.series=Universitext&amp;rft.pages=240%2C+261&amp;rft.pub=Springer-Verlag&amp;rft.date=1992&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1007%2F978-1-4612-4404-2&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fmathscinet.ams.org%2Fmathscinet-getitem%3Fmr%3D1194180%23id-name%3DMR&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A117095021%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft.isbn=0-387-97709-0&amp;rft.aulast=Dimca&amp;rft.aufirst=Alexandru&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AHodge+structure" class="Z3988" about="#mwt162" id="mwAps"></span> (Gives a formula and generators for mixed Hodge numbers of affine <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milnor_map" title="Milnor map" id="mwApw">Milnor fiber</a> of a weighted homogenous polynomial, and also a formula for complements of weighted homogeneous polynomials in a weighted projective space.)</li></ul>

